  skillDescription: "<color=#FFD700>Base (2★):</color> ATK, DEF, and RES increase as HP falls: +1% per 1% HP missing, up to +60% at 40% HP or lower. Attack speed is not affected. Restores 20% of physical damage dealt as HP and cannot be healed by other operators.\n<color=#FFD700>1st upgrade (3★):</color> after landing a hit, has a 100% chance to dodge incoming attacks for 0.5 seconds.\n<color=#FFD700>2nd upgrade (4★):</color> the first time HP reaches 0 each wave, revives with at least 50% HP; reaching 0 again that wave is fatal."
